{
    "title": "The Phoenix: A sober community",
    "description": "<b>Welcome to The Phoenix - where we rise, recover, and enjoy the journey of sobriety together!</b>\r\n\r\nMembership is FREE - the only cost is 48 hours of continuous sobriety!\r\n\r\nThe Phoenix is more than an app, it's a sober community. Through social events, fitness classes, and other meaningful activities, we\u2019re creating safe spaces for all individuals to <b>connect, build friendships, find support, and have fun.</b>\r\n\r\nUnlock the door to a supportive community that believes in you even when you find it hard to believe in yourself. \r\n\r\nWith us, sobriety isn\u2019t just a goal\u2014it\u2019s a journey we embark on together, finding strength, resilience, and hope in each other's experiences and successes.\r\n\r\n\u2014--------\r\n<b>Why The Phoenix?</b>\r\n\u2014--------\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Activities for fitness lovers</b>: Yoga, dance, hiking & walking, boxing, rock climbing, biking, CrossFit, and more. \r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Non-fitness activities:</b> Music, art, game nights and more!\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Over 300,000 members</b> served across <b>48 states</b> and <b>278 counties</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Join communities based on shared interests and location\r\n\r\n\u2022 Post to your feed, chat, and engage with a supportive community\r\n\r\n\u2022 Enjoy a personal space to track and celebrate your sobriety milestones.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Join A Supportive Community</b>\r\n\r\nBecome a part of a robust community with over 300,000 like-minded individuals. Our presence spans across 48 states and 278 counties, ensuring that you\u2019re never alone, no matter where you are.\r\n\r\n<b>Customized Experience</b>\r\n\r\nAt The Phoenix, we believe in inclusivity. That\u2019s why we offer activities that cater to all interests and fitness levels, ensuring everyone feels welcome, challenged and supported in their sobriety journey. \r\n\r\n<b>Interest and Location-Based Spaces</b>\r\n\r\nJoin community \u201cspaces\u201d based on shared interests and location, ensuring that your experience is as engaging and supportive as possible. \r\n\r\n<b>Meet & Connect With Friends</b>\r\n\r\nExperience the power of social connection! Post, engage and connect with peers who understand your journey, offering their support, advice and experiences to help strengthen your path to sobriety.\r\n\r\n<b>Track Your Journey</b>\r\n\r\nCelebrate every milestone! Our app provides a personalized space where you can track your sobriety journey, recognizing and celebrating each step you take towards a sober, fulfilling life. \r\n\r\n<b>A sober community is just a tap away. Download the app and see what we\u2019re all about!</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Welcome to The Phoenix - where we rise, recover, and enjoy the journey of sobriety together!</b><br><br>Membership is FREE - the only cost is 48 hours of continuous sobriety!<br><br>The Phoenix is more than an app, it&#39;s a sober community. Through social events, fitness classes, and other meaningful activities, we\u2019re creating safe spaces for all individuals to <b>connect, build friendships, find support, and have fun.</b><br><br>Unlock the door to a supportive community that believes in you even when you find it hard to believe in yourself. <br><br>With us, sobriety isn\u2019t just a goal\u2014it\u2019s a journey we embark on together, finding strength, resilience, and hope in each other&#39;s experiences and successes.<br><br>\u2014--------<br><b>Why The Phoenix?</b><br>\u2014--------<br><br>\u2022 <b>Activities for fitness lovers</b>: Yoga, dance, hiking &amp; walking, boxing, rock climbing, biking, CrossFit, and more. <br><br>\u2022 <b>Non-fitness activities:</b> Music, art, game nights and more!<br><br>\u2022 <b>Over 300,000 members</b> served across <b>48 states</b> and <b>278 counties</b><br><br>\u2022 Join communities based on shared interests and location<br><br>\u2022 Post to your feed, chat, and engage with a supportive community<br><br>\u2022 Enjoy a personal space to track and celebrate your sobriety milestones.<br><br><br><b>Join A Supportive Community</b><br><br>Become a part of a robust community with over 300,000 like-minded individuals. Our presence spans across 48 states and 278 counties, ensuring that you\u2019re never alone, no matter where you are.<br><br><b>Customized Experience</b><br><br>At The Phoenix, we believe in inclusivity. That\u2019s why we offer activities that cater to all interests and fitness levels, ensuring everyone feels welcome, challenged and supported in their sobriety journey. <br><br><b>Interest and Location-Based Spaces</b><br><br>Join community \u201cspaces\u201d based on shared interests and location, ensuring that your experience is as engaging and supportive as possible. <br><br><b>Meet &amp; Connect With Friends</b><br><br>Experience the power of social connection! Post, engage and connect with peers who understand your journey, offering their support, advice and experiences to help strengthen your path to sobriety.<br><br><b>Track Your Journey</b><br><br>Celebrate every milestone! Our app provides a personalized space where you can track your sobriety journey, recognizing and celebrating each step you take towards a sober, fulfilling life. <br><br><b>A sober community is just a tap away. Download the app and see what we\u2019re all about!</b>",
